topic view without header/footer  </td></tr>\n<tr><td>  <code>view.print.tmpl</code>  </td><td>  Skin for printable topic view with a simple header/footer  </td></tr>\n<tr><td>  <code>view.rss.tmpl</code>  </td><td>  Skin for topic view in RDF XML format  </td></tr>\n<tr><td>  <code>view.tmpl</code>  </td><td>  Main topic view - the standard regular Web page  </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p />\n<h2><a name="TWiki_File_System_Snapshot"> TWiki File System Snapshot </a></h2>\n<p />\nThe following partial directory listings from a Linux installation show typical file permissions and ownership. This is provided for general debugging use only and isn't an exact representation of the current distribution. \n<ul>\n<li> <img src="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/pub/TWiki/TWikiDocGraphics/tip.gif" border="0" alt="TIP" width="16" height="16" /> <strong><em>On an ISP installation...</em></strong> The user and group - <code>twiki twiki</code> - will probably be your domain or login name, eg: <code>yourdomain yourdomain</code> and can't be changed; same for <code>nobody nobody</code> files further down. Also, in the <code><b>bin</b></code> directory, scripts might need a <code><b>.cgi</b></code> (sometimes <code><b>.pl</b></code>) extension._\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />\nDirectory <code>twiki/bin</code>:\n<p />\n<pre>\ndrwxrwxr-x    2 twiki  twiki        4096 Jan  7 23:56 .\ndrwxrwxr-x    5 twiki  twiki        4096 Nov 18 12:21 ..\n-rw-rw-r--    1 twiki  twiki         979 Aug  3 19:36 .htaccess\n-rw-rw-r--    1 twiki  twiki        1598 Jun  1  2002 .htaccess.txt\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        4986 Jan  4 17:27 attach\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        3734 Jan  4 17:27 changes\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        9362 Jan  4 18:04 edit\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        1878 Jan  4 17:28 geturl\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        4587 Jan  4 17:28 installpasswd\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        7231 Jan  6 09:04 mailnotify\n-rwxrwxr-x    1 twiki  twiki        6000 Dec 11 01:26 makedistr