ki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiPreferences</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiPreferences</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiFuncModule">\n  <title>TWikiFuncModule</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiFuncModule</link>\n  <description> TOC STARTINCLUDE # TWiki::Func Module Documentation Official list of stable TWiki functions for Plugin developers Description This module defines official funtions ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-02T01:02:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.3</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiFuncModule</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiFuncModule</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiUpgradeGuide">\n  <title>TWikiUpgradeGuide</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiUpgradeGuide</link>\n  <description> TOC STARTINCLUDE # TWiki Upgrade Guide Upgrade from the previous TWiki 01-Dec-2001 production release to TWiki 01-Feb-2003 Overview This guide describes how to upgrade ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-02T00:06:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.3</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiUpgradeGuide</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiUpgradeGuide</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TextFormattingRules">\n  <title>TextFormattingRules</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TextFormattingRules</link>\n  <description> TOC{depth "4"} STARTINCLUDE # TWiki Text Formatting Working in TWiki is as easy as typing in text  exactly like email . You don't need to know HTML, though you can ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T20:47:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.37</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TextFormattingRules</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TextFormattingRules</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiAdminCookBook">\n  <title>TWikiAdminCookBook</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiAdminCookBook</link>\n  <description> TWiki Admin Cook Book This page has many tips and tricks, particularly useful when you're installing TWiki for the first time. This guide is most useful RED before ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T20:46:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.2</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiAdminCookBook</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiAdminCookBook</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiTemplates">\n  <title>TWikiTemplates</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiTemplates</link>\n  <description> TOC STARTINCLUDE # TWiki Templates Definition of the templates used to render all HTML pages displayed in TWiki Overview The new modular template system offers flexible ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T12:46:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.18</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiTemplates</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiTemplates</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/IncludeTopicsAndWebPages">\n  <title>IncludeTopicsAndWebPages</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/IncludeTopicsAndWebPages</link>\n  <description> Include Topics and Web Pages Using INCLUDE{...} Variable Use the INCLUDE{...} variable to embed the content of another topic or web page inside a TWiki topic. The ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T12:26:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.6</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/IncludeTopicsAndWebPages</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/IncludeTopicsAndWebPages</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiTopics">\n  <title>TWikiTopics</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiTopics</link>\n  <description> TWiki Topics TOC The basic building block of a TWiki site is called a topic , identified by a unique, hopefully descriptive, TWIKIWEB .WikiWord title. It may seem ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T11:46:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.12</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiTopics</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/TWikiTopics</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebHome">\n  <title>WebHome</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebHome</link>\n  <description> Welcome to TWiki: a flexible, powerful, secure, yet simple web-based collaboration platform. Use TWiki to run a project development space, a document management system ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T10:09:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.78</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebHome</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebHome</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<item rdf:about="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/StartingPoints">\n  <title>StartingPoints</title>\n  <link>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/StartingPoints</link>\n  <description>Welcome to TWiki. This page assumes that you are a new user to TWiki, and that you've never heard of Wiki before. Here are the most important pages you should know ...</description>\n  <dc:date>2003-02-01T10:06:00Z</dc:date>\n  <dc:contributor>\n    <rdf:Description link="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/view?topic=Main.PeterThoeny">\n      <rdf:value>thoeny</rdf:value>\n    </rdf:Description>\n  </dc:contributor>\n  <wiki:version>1.3</wiki:version>\n  <wiki:status>updated</wiki:status>\n  <wiki:importance>major</wiki:importance>\n  <wiki:diff>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/StartingPoints</wiki:diff>\n  <wiki:history>http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/StartingPoints</wiki:history>\n</item>\n<p />&nbsp;<p />\n<hr /><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n<tr bgcolor="#FFE0B0">\n  <td width="60%">\n    <h1><a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebRssBase">WebRssBase</a>  &nbsp;</h1>\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebRssBase">30 Jan 2003 - 08:11</a> - <b>NEW</b> &nbsp;\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/view/Main/PeterThoeny">PeterThoeny</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n<p />\n<h2><a name="RSS_Feed"> </a> RSS Feed </h2>\n<p />\nThis is the base for the RSS feed for each web. \n<p />\nEach web has a <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebRss">WebRss</a> that should contain the following text:\n<p />\n<hr />\n<pre>\n&lt;channel rdf:about="%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/%INCLUDINGWEB%">\n  &lt;title>%WIKITOOLNAME%'s %INCLUDINGWEB% web&lt;/title>\n  &lt;link>%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/%INCLUDINGWEB%&lt;/link>\n  &lt;description>(the description of the web). TWiki is a Web-Based Collaboration Platform for the Corporate World.&lt;/description>\n%INCLUDE{"%TWIKIWEB%.WebRssBase"}%\n</pre>\n<p />\nBelow part is included by each WebRss topic:\n<p />\n<hr />\n<pre>\n%STARTINCLUDE%  &lt;image rdf:resource="%PUBURL%/twikilogo88x31.gif" />\n  &lt;dc:language>en-us&lt;/dc:language>\n  &lt;dc:rights>Copyright %GMTIME{"$year"}%, Peter Thoeny and contributing authors.&lt;/dc:rights>\n  &lt;dc:publisher>Peter Thoeny [Peter@Thoeny.com]&lt;/dc:publisher>\n  &lt;dc:creator>Peter Thoeny [Peter@Thoeny.com]&lt;/dc:creator>\n  &lt;dc:source>TWiki&lt;/dc:source>\n  &lt;wiki:interwiki>\n    &lt;rdf:Description link="%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/%INCLUDINGWEB%/">\n      &lt;rdf:value>TWiki.%INCLUDINGWEB%&lt;/rdf:value>\n    &lt;/rdf:Description>\n  &lt;/wiki:interwiki>\n  &lt;items>\n    &lt;rdf:Seq>\n%SEARCH{".*" web="%INCLUDINGWEB%" regex="on" nosearch="on" order="modified" reverse="on" nototal="on" limit="16" format="      &lt;rdf:li rdf:resource=\\"%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/$web/$topic\\" />"}%\n    &lt;/rdf:Seq>\n  &lt;/items>\n&lt;/channel>\n&lt;image rdf:about="%PUBURL%/twikilogo88x31.gif">\n  &lt;title>TWiki.%INCLUDINGWEB%&lt;/title>\n  &lt;link>%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/%INCLUDINGWEB%&lt;/link>\n  &lt;url>%PUBURL%/%TWIKIWEB%/TWikiLogos/twikilogo88x31.gif&lt;/url>\n&lt;/image>\n%SEARCH{".*" web="%INCLUDINGWEB%" regex="on" nosearch="on" order="modified" reverse="on" nototal="on" limit="16" format="&lt;item rdf:about=\\"%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/$web/$topic\\">$n  &lt;title>$topic&lt;/title>$n  &lt;link>%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/$web/$topic&lt;/link>$n  &lt;description>$summary&lt;/description>$n  &lt;dc:date>$isodate&lt;/dc:date>$n  &lt;dc:contributor>$n    &lt;rdf:Description link=\\"%SCRIPTURL%/view%SCRIPTSUFFIX%?topic=$wikiusername\\">$n      &lt;rdf:value>$username&lt;/rdf:value>$n    &lt;/rdf:Description>$n  &lt;/dc:contributor>$n  &lt;wiki:version>$rev&lt;/wiki:version>$n  &lt;wiki:status>updated&lt;/wiki:status>$n  &lt;wiki:importance>major&lt;/wiki:importance>$n  &lt;wiki:diff>%SCRIPTURL%/rdiff%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/$web/$topic&lt;/wiki:diff>$n  &lt;wiki:history>%SCRIPTURL%/rdiff%SCRIPTSUFFIX%/$web/$topic&lt;/wiki:history>$n&lt;/item>"}%\n%STOPINCLUDE%\n</pre>\n<hr />\n<p />\n<strong><em>See also</em></strong>: <a href="http://twiki.org/cgi-bin/view/Codev/RichSiteSummary" title="'Codev/RichSiteSummary' on TWiki site, we know it!">TWiki:Codev/RichSiteSummary</a>, <a href="http://twiki.org/cgi-bin/view/Codev/TWikiSyndication" title="'Codev/TWikiSyndication' on TWiki site, we know it!">TWiki:Codev/TWikiSyndication</a> \n<p />\n-- <a href="/twiki/bin/view/Main/PeterThoeny">PeterThoeny</a> - 30 Jan 2003\n<p />&nbsp;<p />\n<hr /><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n<tr bgcolor="#FFE0B0">\n  <td width="60%">\n    <h1><a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebSearch">WebSearch</a>  &nbsp;</h1>\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebSearch">19 Jan 2003 - 08:58</a> - r1.12 &nbsp;\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/view/Main/PeterThoeny">PeterThoeny</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n<p />\n<form action="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/">\n<ul>\n<li> <b>Simple search</b>:\n   <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>\n     <input type="radio" name="scope" value="text" checked="checked" /> Topic text (body) &nbsp; &nbsp;\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="web" /> All webs (not only TWiki web)\n   </td></tr><tr><td>\n     <input type="radio" name="scope" value="topic" /> Topic name\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="bookview" /> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/BookView">BookView</a>\n   </td></tr></table>\n   <input type="text" name="search" size="32" />\n   <input type="submit" value="Search text" />\n</li>\n</ul>\n</form>\n<p />\n<p />\n<form action="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/">\n<ul>\n<li> <b>Advanced search</b>:\n   <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>\n     <input type="radio" name="scope" value="text" checked="checked" /> Topic text (body) &nbsp; &nbsp;\n   </td><td>\n     Search\n   </td><td>\n     <select name="web">\n     <option value="all">all public</option>\n     <option>TWiki</option>\n     <option>Know</option>\n     <option>Main</option>\n     <option>Sandbox</option>\n     <option>TWiki</option>\n     </select>\n     web(s)\n   </td></tr><tr><td>\n     <input type="radio" name="scope" value="topic" /> Topic name\n   </td><td>\n     Sort by\n   </td><td>\n     <select name="order">\n     <option VALUE="topic">Topic name</option>\n     <option VALUE="modified">Last modified time</option>\n     <option VALUE="editby">Last editor</option>\n     </select> in\n     <input type="checkbox" name="reverse" /> reversed order\n   </td></tr></table>\n   <input type="text" name="search" size="32" />\n   <input type="submit" value="Search text" /> <br>\n   <table><tr><td>\n     Make search:\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="casesensitive" /> Case sensitive\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="regex" /> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/RegularExpression">RegularExpression</a> search (semicolon ';' for <em>and</em>)\n   </td></tr><tr><td>\n     Don't show:\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="nosearch" /> search string\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="nosummary" /> summaries &nbsp; &nbsp;\n     <input type="checkbox" name="nototal" /> total matches\n   </td></tr><tr><td>\n     Do show:\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="bookview" /> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/BookView">BookView</a>\n   </td><td>\n     <input type="checkbox" name="showlock" /> locked topic &nbsp;\n     <input type="text" name="limit" size="5" value="all" /> topics (result count)\n   </td></tr></table>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</form>\n<p />\n<ul>\n<li> <b><a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=\\.*">Topic index</a></b>: List of TWiki topics in alphabetical order. <br />\n     <b>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=\\.*">All</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ea">A</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eb">B</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ec">C</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ed">D</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ee">E</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ef">F</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eg">G</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eh">H</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ei">I</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ej">J</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ek">K</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5El">L</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Em">M</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5En">N</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eo">O</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ep">P</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eq">Q</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Er">R</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Es">S</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Et">T</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Eu">U</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ev">V</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ew">W</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ex">X</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ey">Y</a>|<a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;search=%5Ez">Z</a>| <br />\n     | <a href="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/?scope=topic&amp;regex=on&amp;bookview=on&amp;search=\\.*">All</a></b> topics in <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/BookView">BookView</a> <b>|</b>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />\n<ul>\n<li> <b>Jump to topic</b>: If you already know the name of the topic, enter the name of the topic at the second line of this page.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />\n<ul>\n<li> <b> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebChanges">WebChanges</a></b>: Find out what topics in TWiki have changed recently.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />\n<ul>\n<li> <b><a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/GoodStyle">How to edit text</a></b>:\n<ul>\n<li> Make changes to topics in <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/GoodStyle">GoodStyle</a>,\n</li>\n<li> Learn the <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TextFormattingRules">TextFormattingRules</a>, and\n</li>\n<li> Have a look at the <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TextFormattingFAQ">TextFormattingFAQ</a>.\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />&nbsp;<p />\n<hr /><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n<tr bgcolor="#FFE0B0">\n  <td width="60%">\n    <h1><a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebSiteTools">WebSiteTools</a>  &nbsp;</h1>\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebSiteTools">08 Jan 2003 - 07:17</a> - r1.3 &nbsp;\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/view/Main/PeterThoeny">PeterThoeny</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n<p />\n<h1><a name="Web_Site_Tools"> Web Site Tools </a></h1>\n<p />\n<form action="/twiki/bin/search/TWiki/SearchResult">\n<ul>\n<li> <input type="text" name="search" size="32" /> <input type="submit" value="Search" /> &nbsp;&nbsp; (More options in <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebSearch">WebSearch</a>)\n</li>\n<li> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebChanges">WebChanges</a>: Display recent changes to the TWiki web\n</li>\n<li> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebIndex">WebIndex</a>: List all TWiki topics in alphabetical order. See also the faster <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebTopicList">WebTopicList</a>\n</li>\n<li> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebNotify">WebNotify</a>: Subscribe to an e-mail alert sent when something changes in the TWiki web\n</li>\n<li> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebStatistics">WebStatistics</a>: View access statistics of the TWiki web\n</li>\n<li> <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebPreferences">WebPreferences</a>: Preferences of the TWiki web (<a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiPreferences">TWikiPreferences</a> has site-wide preferences)\n</li>\n</ul>\n</form>\n<p />\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li> The list above provides the <a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/TWikiSiteTools">TWikiSiteTools</a> used to navigate, search and maintain a particular web. It is included within other topics using the following directive: <p />\n     <code>%INCLUDE{"%TWIKIWEB%.WebSiteTools"}%</code>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />\n<ul>\n<li> <a href="http://172.18.0.10/twiki/bin/search/TWiki?scope=text&amp;web=all&amp;search=%25INCLUDE%7B%22%25TWIKIWEB%25.WebSiteTools%22%7D%25&amp;casesensitive=on&amp;nosummary=on&amp;nototal=on" target="_top">List</a> all topics which include this WebSiteTools topic.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p />&nbsp;<p />\n<hr /><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">\n<tr bgcolor="#FFE0B0">\n  <td width="60%">\n    <h1><a href="/twiki/bin/view/TWiki/WebStatistics">WebStatistics</a>  &nbsp;</h1>\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/rdiff/TWiki/WebStatistics">12 Sep 2026 - 13:27</a> - r1.4 &nbsp;\n  </td><td width="20%">\n    <a href="/twiki/bin/view/Main/TWikiGuest">TWikiGuest</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n<p />\n<h2><a name="Statistics_for_TWiki_Web"> Statistics for TWiki Web </a></h2>\n<p />\n<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="1"> <tr><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>Month:</strong> </th><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>Topic <br> views:</strong> </th><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>Topic <br> saves:</strong> </th><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>File <br> uploads:</strong> </th><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>Most popular <br> topic views:</strong> </th><th bgcolor="#99CCCC"> <strong>Top contributors for <br> topic save and uploads:</strong> </th></tr>\n<tr><td>  <!--statDate-->  </td><td>  <!--statViews-->  </td><td>  <!--statSaves-->  </td><td>  <!--statUploads-->  </td><td>  <!--statTopViews-->  </td><td>  <!--statTopContributors-->  </td></tr>\n<tr><td>  Sep 2026  </td><td al